<title>FRANCE: Shares in Eurotunnel suspended in Paris.</title>
<headline>Shares in Eurotunnel suspended in Paris.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc were suspended on Thursday ahead of an extraordinary shareholders meeting this afternoon and in expectation of a company announcement, French stockmarkets association SBF said on Thursday.</p>
<p>SBF said the suspension applied to all types of shares, warrants and options and that they would requote normally on Friday, July 11.</p>
<p>SBF said the suspension was at the request of the Eurotunnel companies.</p>
<p>Shares in Eurotunnel closed on Wednesday at 8.05 francs in Paris and 81.5 pence in London.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
